pros- excellent soundtrack, superb graphics, great chartacters, great character development, intense deep story(will give u those goosebumps), fun/flasy battle system (can be starategic with paridigm shifts}, and breathtaking environments.
cons- Too linear, making it hard to connect with the world and its citzens. Story can be hard to understand if u dont read/go through datalog,auto-battle feature is annoying at times, cant really control ur other characters, party leader dies? game over, meh post-content and hunts, can only really explore and experience one area (Gran pulse) therefore making it the other environments in the game a wasted opportunity, meaning it doesnt have that true final fantasy feel where u stumble across town meeting the citizens and visting shops, its just too linear in the worst way possible (Not a bad thing for me makes it like an interactive movie}
Conculsion: Despite the cons which isnt really a big deal for me, the game still delivers in the most important aspects of final fantasy game/jrpg that  it has a superb soundtrack,characters,story-telling and a fun and somewhat strategic atb battle system.

